5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in such fine company. Since we begin with a clean slate, let us treat one another with kindness and patience as we seek the truth together. What are your thoughts?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Servas. Since we have no information yet, the best approach is to observe everyone's behavior and communication patterns. Let's keep the conversation open and see how we all react to the pressure.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,I concur with both of you. A measured approach is best. I shall spend my time observing from the sidelines and reflecting on our discourse. Let us see how the situation unfolds naturally.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Observation is a sensible starting point. I agree with Minako; we should focus on identifying inconsistencies in how people present themselves. I will be paying close attention to the logic behind everyone's arguments.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm so excited to play! Hehe! This is like a big mystery game, right? I'll be looking for anyone who looks nervous or is acting super weird! Let's all have fun and find the wolf together!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is wonderful to see such vibrant energy from Sakura. While we seek the wolf, let us not forget to cherish the bonds we form. @Minako, @Asuka, how do you plan to balance logic with trust?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Trust is a necessary tool for cooperation, but it must be earned through consistency. I intend to trust the group's collective effort while remaining objective. Logic will be my primary guide to ensure that trust isn't misplaced.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,"I believe trust is a fragile thing, and placing it too quickly can be a mistake. I prefer to rely on my own judgment and experience. I will be watching to see who is truly sincere.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, trust is a liability if it is not backed by evidence. I do not believe in balancing the two; rather, I believe trust should be the result of logical verification. I will remain skeptical until proven otherwise.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! Hehe! But that's okay, because I'll be the one bringing the fun! I think if we're all friendly, the wolf will get confused and accidentally give themselves away! Right?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"A fascinating perspective, Sakura. Sometimes a joyful heart can see what a calculating mind misses. @George, you mentioned relying on your own judgment; what specific signs of sincerity do you look for in others?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"While George considers sincerity, I am more interested in how the others respond to his skepticism. @Sakura, your friendliness is charming, but remember that a wolf can also use a cheerful mask to deflect suspicion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,"@Servas, sincerity often reveals itself in the gaps between words and actions. I look for those who remain steady when the wind shifts, rather than those who simply echo the loudest voice in the room.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@George, your focus on stability is logical. However, we must also consider that a calculated player can simulate steadiness. I will be analyzing whether that stability is genuine or a carefully maintained facade.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, a mask? That sounds like a costume party! Hehe! But I'm just being me! I'll be a super-detective and find the real mask! I bet the wolf is hiding right in front of us!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"It has been a most enlightening first day. Let us carry this spirit of openness into the night. I wish you all a peaceful sleep, and may the Seer's vision be clear. I look forward to tomorrow.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us remain observant and mindful of the patterns we've seen today. I wish you all a restful night. I look forward to seeing what the morning brings.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,George,,I shall retire as well. I hope the night brings clarity to the Seer and peace to the rest of us. I will be reflecting on our words until we meet again. Goodnight.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will also retire. I'll be reviewing today's discourse to see if any contradictions emerge once we have more data tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to dream about catching the wolf with a giant net! Hehe! I hope the Seer finds something super spooky and helpful tonight! See you all tomorrow! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
