69,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy morning, for we have lost two of our companions. My heart goes out to Asuka; though her words were sharp, her spirit was dedicated to the truth. Let us find strength in our unity now.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,George,,"It is a somber start. Asuka's departure leaves a void in our logical analysis, and the attack on Minako suggests the wolf is moving with purpose. We must now be even more vigilant, as our numbers dwindle.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Asuka is gone and Minako got attacked! That's so scary! Hehe, but wait... if the wolf attacked Minako, does that mean Minako is a good person? My detective heart says yes! Who's the real wolf now?!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Sakura, your heart is as bright as ever. It is likely that Minako was indeed a good soul, for the wolf rarely strikes those who are already gone. @George, with our circle shrinking, how do you read the current silence?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minako"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,George,,"@Servas, the silence is heavy, but it is also revealing. With Asuka gone, the wolf may feel more comfortable blending in. I suspect the wolf is now waiting for us to turn on each other in our desperation.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@George, that sounds like a movie plot! Hehe! But I won't let the wolf trick me! @Servas, you're always so calm, it's almost like you're a magic wizard! Do you have any secret clues for us?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A magic wizard, Sakura? You flatter me. My only secret is that life has taught me the value of a steady heart. I have no clues, but I believe the truth will emerge if we remain honest. @George, do you suspect anyone?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,George,,"@Servas, I find it difficult to name a suspect without evidence. However, the wolf's strategy seems to be one of invisibility. I am wondering if the wolf is hiding behind a mask of extreme kindness or simple cheer.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@George, that's not fair! Hehe! Being cheerful isn't a mask, it's just me! Are you saying I'm the wolf? That would be a super big twist! But I'm a good girl, I promise! Who do you *really* think it is?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a delicate balance we strike, George. While cheer can be a mask, it can also be a shield of innocence. Let us not let suspicion poison our spirits. I believe we must look at the patterns of the night.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,George,,"The patterns of the night are indeed telling. The wolf chose to eliminate Minako, who was a stabilizing force. If we are to survive, we must decide if the wolf is the one guiding our emotions or the one hiding in plain sight.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@George, you're being all mysterious again! Hehe! But if the wolf is hiding in plain sight, maybe they're just pretending to be a boring adult! @Servas, do you think George is being too suspicious? I'm voting with my heart!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
